\pard\b\fs20 Occupation\b0\par
\fs16\par
The Oasis of the Three Saints is a strategically important point on the Kanderian border. That is why there are always quarrels between groups that want to control this important place. Only a group that has taken all three sanctuaries can keep the other groups away and secure its position.\par
So the goal for each group, which starts with one sanctuary, is to own all three. You always respawn at one of your own sanctuaries, as long as your team still has one. Otherwise you have to wait until your team has one again.\par
